{"id":767,"date":"2016-04-18T22:18:07","date_gmt":"2016-04-19T03:18:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbbaldwin.wordpress.com\/?p=767"},"modified":"2016-04-18T22:18:10","modified_gmt":"2016-04-19T03:18:10","slug":"super-windy-at-judy-bobs","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/04\/18\/super-windy-at-judy-bobs\/","title":{"rendered":"Super Windy at Judy &amp; Bob&#8217;s !!!!!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>So after we got back from some of our sightseeing on Saturday, we just sat on the back patio and Judy and Bob&#8217;s. \u00a0They have a beautiful home with an even more beautiful back yard.<\/p>\n<p>Judy served us fresh-made iced tea and we sat under the patio umbrella and talked and shared family photos with each other. \u00a0It was an absolute gorgeous afternoon, about 80 degrees, but with a healthy &#8220;Breeze&#8221;.<\/p>\n<p>After a few hours, we decided to step inside for a bit before heading back to the RV park for the night. \u00a0Just as we got inside we heard a large &#8220;Clunk-Clunk&#8221; on the roof. \u00a0We ran outside to see &#8220;what was the clatter&#8221; and, &#8230;. well, you&#8217;ll just have to check out the pictures to see for yourself.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-767 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-16-17-52-47.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-16-17-52-47-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/2016-04-16-13-40-14.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"h